# The checked-in patch must reach every clone byte for byte.
#   -text            never convert line endings. Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true rewrites the
#                    patch with CRLF and `git apply` then fails or, worse, creates subtly wrong files.
#   -diff            show it as "binary file changed" in diffs and pull requests instead of 13,000 lines of noise
#   linguist-generated   GitHub collapses it and leaves it out of language statistics
# It is generated by `npm run patch`; don't edit it by hand.
patches/*.patch -text -diff linguist-generated=true
